{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"天氣報告｜天晴乾燥　隨後一兩日風勢較大\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/OBS-FORECAST-261025-07.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】本港地區今日(10月25日)天氣預測，天晴乾燥。日間市區最高氣溫約31度，新界再高一兩度。吹和緩北至東北風。</p><p>展望明日大致天晴。隨後一兩日風勢較大，雲量逐漸增多。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T23:59:56.809730+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":89,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T23:30:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-25T02:38:17.492787+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T23:58:04.144150+00:00","content_hash":"4f47fc0af2cb38ae374bc2f5cfd0d9ad88ed233f733f6cad1f74a4a6862bc47e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}